OL,3,GNEWSAFunding frenzy adds to pressure on
OL,4,Aworried farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer said it was "very, very
OL,7,Fworrying" to miss out on funding from a
OL,8,Fnew government scheme to support green
OL,9,Fprojects.
OL,11,FLex Brun from Great Massingham in
OL,12,FNorfolk said he hoped to get #100,000
OL,13,Ffrom the Sustainable Farming Initiative
OL,14,F(SFI), but applications closed down in
OL,15,Fless than six hours.
OL,17,FThe Country Land and Business
OL,18,FAssociation (CLA) said Brun was one of
OL,19,Fmany unsuccessful farmers and may now
OL,20,Fhave to cut back on environmental
OL,21,Fschemes.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
