OL,3,GNEWSAFunding frenzy adds to pressure on
OL,4,Aworried farmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the government said there would
OL,7,Fbe more funding next year, farming
OL,8,Fminister Stephen Morgan said he had
OL,9,F"heard" concerns and that lessons would
OL,10,Fbe learned.
